  "annotations_dropped": [
    {
      "annotation_id": "f3ea323293624fb4bf2449368c18cbf9_49",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "At the outset, the preliminary objection relating to the maintainability of the writ petition needs to be addressed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b8a6ec4944184042b74c66763004c69f_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Though, the contention of the respondents that matters of classification should be best left alone to the tribunals does bear consideration, the fact remains that the writ petition has been pending before this court for the past one year an"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "01c7fa9cacaf47539c3ecf3cde5bcdb9_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nIn any event, the existence of an alternative remedy does not bar judicial review, under Article 226 of the Constitution of India."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b7f0e96ac78844efbe08e1f1a51e46fc_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The decision, whether such a review is to be taken up or not, is within the sole purview of this court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c95463749f4b44efbc3ed053b03a2d59_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accordingly, this objection is rejected."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6c77470a58a14390a86fff15d8b5317e_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "10. The petitioner was earlier taxed under the Central Excise Act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f5f8e9e2838c4ac39ea51387ffea3cf4_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "At that stage, the petitioner paid tax on flavoured milk under 2202."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2c349f96c973480290376a98b85ce42e_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner, after the GST regime came into effect, paid tax by classifying flavoured milk under 0402."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6bcfa55026954b7fbba8f1707b7d2658_57",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This change of classification is said to have been done as the petitioner had realized that it had classified flavoured milk under the wrong tariff entry."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2944db58bcde45cc94482f2c1341bd18_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The description of the relevant entries during Pre and Post GST Regime are as follows:\nChapter Heading Description during Description during Pre-GST Regime Post-GST Regime (Central Excise Tariff (GST Tariff) Act) First Schedule of Milk and "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "db27d813842f46b5abffe180da165bd7_59",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "First Schedule of Milk and cream, Milk and cream, Section-I Tariff Item-0402 concentrated or concentrated or containing added containing added sugar or other sugar or other sweetening matter."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cce9e5a2719c475b85580d21aecdd866_60",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "sweetening matter including skimmed milk powder, milk food for babies (other than condensed)\n11."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "78ce0e4917564810b94e63319690b7c6_61",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The primary finding of the 1st respondent, to remove flavoured milk from tariff heading 0402 99 90 is that flavoured milk, with the addition of Badam flavour, ceases to be milk and becomes a special drink."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9e27e536bbac407a9b97b08da51cd125_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Entry 0402 at the cost of repetition, reads as follows:\nFirst Schedule of Milk and cream, Milk and cream, Section-I Tariff Item-0402 concentrated or concentrated or containing added containing added sugar or other sugar or other sweetening "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d212bd1108ab4e75a35be365400d77e4_63",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "sweetening matter including skimmed milk powder, milk food for babies (other than condensed)\n12."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9cdb76662ad249b3ad02846f4dc09680_64",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The first issue that comes up is whether only milk is to be treated under 0402."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cfc1342ad8124b2e91e2ca96ecac5575_65",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The said entry not only enumerates milk per se but also cream, skimmed milk powder, milk food for babies etc."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ca58bec2669047edb729201e70566dbd_66",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It M/S. Sri Vijaya Visakha Milk Producers ... vs Asst. Commissioner Of Central Tax, on 10 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/59808889/\n4 includes even plain or concentrated milk containing sugar or other sweetening m"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e79c3d6cd14f4e0793edccce66b34963_67",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This entry clearly incorporates milk and milk products."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "18c03eb3ed554e749f00468da51ad4b4_68",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "For example milk food for babies, by normal standards,\nis not milk."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "332106d2328a46988990357fcf236518_69",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, it is treated as falling in 0402."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "422c3f7a4b2f46638aa7cf0e4f4f2db3_70",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Thus, the test propounded by the 1 st respondent that only plain milk is to be treated as falling under 0402 is not correct."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b0f3916111144609a8944cd5058d4d4a_71",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The finding of the 1st respondent that flavoured milk goes out of this entry by addition of Badam flavour also cannot be accepted."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "71951a44577c4135b536f607d0a4725d_72",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Though the entry speaks only of milk containing added sugar or other sweetening matter, flavoured milk cannot be taken out of tariff heading 0402 merely because of addition of 0.5% of Badam flavour."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bf58bc8c90964dc0a131ce75f590b219_73",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "13. The second ground taken by the 1st respondent is that \"beverage\" is any type of drink except water and as such any milk drink, would fall within 2202."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "15b6b57775804c49b31cb2f43174f54c_74",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This ground is also not available if the earlier entry in Tariff Item 2202 is seen."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "011ab3fdaa464190b85b4acf128a819a_75",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The entries under Chapter heading 22 read as follows:\n "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "80431525d5234384825a207da0b9b7dd_76",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Tariff"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9cb8416b7f96403abed0c711f2ef843f_77",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Item Description of goods 2202 10 --Waters, including mineral waters and aerated waters, containing added sugar or other sweetened matter or flavoured --Other 2202 91 00 --Non alcoholic beer 220299 --Other 2202 99 10 --Soya milk drinks, whe"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "02e0631feae74766a93cebc4c863c77f_78",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "--Other"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4dcdb42534134eabb81fcc6199748a4f_79",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The entries,\nunder this chapter heading, enumerate water, mineral water, aerated water and other beverages which can be made only by using water."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0d8a9255f452422aa91a1ceb3bf0cde2_80",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Except entry 2202 90 90, \"Tender coconut water\", water is an essential part of the beverages mentioned therein."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b4fff139d18c4eb8a9768d963cc03db4_81",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Applying the principle of Nocitur a Sociis, the placement of Tariff Item 2202 90 30 in the same tariff heading would mean that entry 2202 99 30,\nwould cover beverages which contain milk as well as water."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "755e1d7d540a48a9b8db499e84f40837_82",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "14. Another way of looking at this issue is to consider sweetened milk."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "42f61e21f7344a4fad34cd08803b1aea_83",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In a case where sweetened milk is to be sold, after bottling the same, it would fall within the meaning of Milk containing added sugar or other sweetening matter, under 0402."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a500adbab3ac4e94bab440178b77d753_84",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This drink could also be called a beverage,\ncontaining milk, falling under 2202."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3d8270bbd1c446a9be74c45b9ff3695d_85",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The entry, in 0402, is the special entry and the entry, under 2202, is the general entry and would have to give way to entry 0402."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5cc298488fab451d88f12a274ac7af2e_86",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The same principle would apply to flavoured milk."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e9b88a443ba74e159addb8e62e60465f_87",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "15. The Honble High Court at Madras, in its judgement, dated 31.10.2023, in W.P. No. 16608 and 16613 of 2020, in the case of M/s Parle Agro Pvt. Limited Vs. Union of India, after reviewing the law and the changes in the tariff entries, had "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a63093fa79e6427dacdd5b1b3a05d401_88",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "We are fortified, in our conclusion, by this judgment."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4bc237a2c320400bb302a9cf6c8d0ce7_89",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "16. The 1st respondent also sought to levy penalty against the petitioner, on the ground that the petitioner had deliberately sought to evade payment of tax, in terms of Section 122(2)(b) read with Section 74 of the Central GST Act and othe"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e62a4d963d9f4507acede9b84e6050ff_90",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In view of the fact that this Court is of the view that flavoured milk cannot be treated to fall under the Tariff Heading 2202, the question of M/S. Sri Vijaya Visakha Milk Producers ... vs Asst. Commissioner Of Central Tax, on 10 December,"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1203e2f7998f4365a028973487320e38_91",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In any event, the question of whether a penalty can be levied, even if flavoured milk falls within 2202, merely on the ground that the dealer changed his classification of goods from one entry to another is left open."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b1dfafeaa4e740f3a4896df0394ab156_92",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc",
        "explicit_leakage_phrase"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [
        {
          "pattern": "\\bpetition\\s+is\\s+allowed\\b",
          "matched_text": "Petition is allowed",
          "start": 26,
          "end": 45
        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "17. Accordingly, the Writ Petition is allowed, setting aside the impugned order in Original No.14/2023-24 GST-AC (SS)-2023-24, dated 03.10.2023, passed by the 1st respondent."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a430b4d8d2e348a2b5a54f9912209226_93",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There shall be no order as to costs."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ba49765860384d719eb1a773c57e1945_94",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nAs a sequel, miscellaneous petitions, pending if any, shall stand closed."
    }
  ],
